        </param>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Add grid navigation feature to an object. It expects the children to be arranged into a grid-like layout. Although it&apos;s not required to have pixel perfect alignment. This feature makes possible to use keys to navigate among the children and focus them. The keys other than arrows and press/release related events are forwarded to the focused child. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>obj</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>pointer to an object on which navigation should be applied. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>ctrl</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>control flags from <computeroutput>lv_gridnav_ctrl_t</computeroutput>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
